{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026o13lIxvH8I1795405638.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>首隻追離岸人民幣債券的交易所買賣基金掛牌。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_JF.LISTING.RVO-1100_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VFOtYYQY6o1795405634.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>港交所主席唐家成、證監會主席黃天祐及發行商代表出席儀式，ETF追蹤早前推出的彭博離岸人民幣指數，涵蓋300多隻「點心債」。財經事務及庫務局局長許正宇指，產品有助滿足投資者多元配置的需求，鞏固香港作為全球離岸人民幣業務樞紐地位。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"JF.LISTING.BITE.HUI-1100-1_CLEAN.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026U5CZz2bKPO1795405608.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>財經事務及庫務局局長許正宇說︰「人民幣國際化不僅在於支付結算，更在於讓人民幣成為具有國際吸引力的投資及資產配置的貨幣。全球首隻離岸人民幣債券ETF，正正為投資者提供一個高效便捷的參與工具，不僅滿足了國際投資者日益增長的多元配置需求，更加緊密配合了特區政府狀大離岸人民幣資金池，以及持續豐富人民幣投資產品的策略目標。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T04:49:55.582617+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":294,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T03:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T11:17:14.023750+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T04:43:21.234145+00:00","content_hash":"98c643251e665b22129235a224b77ec72245a0d4ba711b9bab72d3eb74653f2c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T04:49:55.582617+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}